Package: ls.dynam
Type: Package
Title: Latent Space Dynamic Network Actor Models with Position-Rate Link
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alberto", "Caimo", email = "alberto.caimo1@ucd.ie",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8956-7166")),
    person("Isabella", "Gollini", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7738-5688")))
Description: Bayesian inference for latent space dynamic network actor models
    With position-rate link relating summaries of the positions that the choice
    model identifies, such as latent popularity and excess self-affinity, to
    the activity effects through a spline regression. 
    Modular posterior inference: the latent positions are estimated from the choice
    model alone via MALA or Laplace approximation, and the
    link is estimated under the plug-in or the cut posterior. 
    The package also provides Bayes factors for the link and its components, 
    held-out predictive scores, calibration by simulation, diagnostics.
